    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 28 Knights Park, a spacious four-bedroom detached bungalow ideally situated in a well-established Tesidential area within easy walking distance of Castlebar Town Centre.\r\nThe property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation comprising a generous Living Room, Fitted Kitchen, Separate Utility, Four bedrooms (one Ensuite) and a family Bathroom. externally, the property benefits from a lawn and tarmacadam driveway to the front, together with a private, South-facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nLocation:-\r\nKnights Park enjoys a highly convenient location within close proximity to local Schools, Shops, Mayo University Hospital and all the amenities of Castlebar Town Centre, making this an attractive opportunity for those seeking a spacious family home in an established Residential setting.\r\nA welcoming home in an established Castlebar Setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The Accommodation comprises:-\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: Carpeted.\r\nLiving Room:\t(14`5”x 16`) With tiled fireplace with back boiler , floor carpeted and coving throughout.\r\nBedroom(1):\t(10`1x 9`7”)  Carpeted and built in units.\r\nHot-press:\tWith immersion.\r\nBedroom(2):(9`7”x 10`6”) With built in units and floor carpeted.\r\nMaster Bedroom:\t(15`6”x 9`7”)\tCarpeted.\r\nEnsuite:\t(4`1”x 7`7”)\tWith electric shower, tiled floor cubicle and white suite.\r\nBathroom:(5`5”x 4`8”)\tWith white Suite and carpeted.\r\nBedroom(4):(11`4”x 8`3”) Carpeted.\r\nKitchen:\t(14`6”x 10`6”) With full range of oak units to include hob and oven, Fridge freezer and tiled floor.\r\nUtility: (4`9”x 8`)\tWith Washing machine and Dryer included.\r\n\r\n•\tPVC Double glazed Windows.\r\n•\tOil Fired Central Heating.\r\n•\tGalvanized Shed in the rear Garden.\r\n•\tBoiler House.\r\n•\tLawn to front with tarmacadam Drive.\r\n•\tGated on both sides.\r\n•\tPrivate rear South facing Garden.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
